    "title_en": "Amplituhedra and origami, II: loop level",
    "abstract_en": "Building on the recently discovered origami-amplituhedron correspondence, we prove that the BCFW (Britto-Cachazo-Feng-Witten) cells triangulate the $m=4$ amplituhedron in full generality at all loop orders, both in momentum and momentum-twistor space. Along the way, we develop two natural \"$L$-punctured\" extensions of the positive Grassmannian and relate them via T-duality.",
